# build context of the meltano image (the repo root): only the meltano project and its requirements file go in.
# paths are relative to the repo root, not to this file
*
!DataWarehouseMeltano
!docker/meltano/requirements.txt

# written by meltano on Windows: the image runs meltano install itself
DataWarehouseMeltano/.meltano
DataWarehouseMeltano/output
DataWarehouseMeltano/.env
